R('c1',709,'Log differentiation requires x>0. Strictly positive second derivative proves convexity, and derivative sign gives global minimum.',C('first derivative',s.diff(x**x,x),x**x*(s.log(x)+1)),C('second derivative',s.diff(x**x,x,2),x**x*((s.log(x)+1)**2+1/x)))
