R('c2',702,'The x-axis rotation uses discs; y-axis uses annuli with radii e and e^y, not a relabelled disc integral.',C('x rotation integral',s.integrate(s.log(x)**2,(x,1,s.E)),s.E-2),C('y rotation integral',s.integrate(s.exp(2)-s.exp(2*x),(x,0,1)),(s.exp(2)+1)/2))
